  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem precoordinated-radiology</b></p><a name=\"precoordinated-radiology\"> </a><a name=\"hcprecoordinated-radiology\"> </a><p><b>Properties</b></p><p><b>This code system defines the following properties for its concepts</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>URI</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td>360037004</td><td>360037004</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>SNOMED CT |Method (attribute)| — the imaging action (e.g. CT, angiography).</td></tr><tr><td>363704007</td><td>363704007</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>SNOMED CT |Procedure site (attribute)| — body region imaged. Multi-valued when the exam covers several regions.</td></tr><tr><td>405813007</td><td>405813007</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>SNOMED CT |Using substance (attribute)| — contrast agent used, when applicable.</td></tr><tr><td>21191007</td><td>21191007</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>Imaging phase relative to contrast administration (pre-contrast, post-contrast). Multi-valued when both phases are acquired (e.g. 'wo/w iv contrast').</td></tr><tr><td>363703001</td><td>363703001</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>SNOMED CT |Has intent (attribute)| — indication / reason for the exam (e.g. stone evaluation).</td></tr><tr><td>272394005</td><td>272394005</td><td>http://snomed.info/sct</td><td>Coding</td><td>Technique qualifier (e.g. low dose).</td></tr></table><p><b>Concepts</b></p><p>This code system supplement <code>https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/drp/CodeSystem/precoordinated-radiology</code> defines properties on the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>360037004</b></td><td><b>363704007</b></td><td><b>405813007</b></td><td><b>21191007</b></td><td><b>363703001</b></td><td><b>272394005</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CT-ABD-W<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CT-ABD-W\"> </a></td><td>CT, abdomen, w iv contrast</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/77477000\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 77477000}\">Computed tomography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/818983003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 818983003}\">Abdominal structure</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/263543005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 263543005}\">Intravenous iodinated contrast</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/SCT-PHASE-POST\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct SCT-PHASE-POST}\">Post-contrast phase</a></td><td/><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CT-ABD-WO<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CT-ABD-WO\"> </a></td><td>CT, abdomen, wo iv contrast</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/77477000\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 77477000}\">Computed tomography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/818983003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 818983003}\">Abdominal structure</a></td><td/><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/707761002\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 707761002}\">Pre-contrast (native) phase</a></td><td/><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CT-ABD-WOW<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CT-ABD-WOW\"> </a></td><td>CT, abdomen, wo/w iv contrast</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/77477000\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 77477000}\">Computed tomography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/818983003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 818983003}\">Abdominal structure</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/263543005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 263543005}\">Intravenous iodinated contrast</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/707761002\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 707761002}\">Pre-contrast (native) phase</a>, <a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/SCT-PHASE-POST\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct SCT-PHASE-POST}\">Post-contrast phase</a></td><td/><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CT-ABDPEL-KUB<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CT-ABDPEL-KUB\"> </a></td><td>CT, abdomen-pelvis, KUB-stone eval, wo iv contrast</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/77477000\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 77477000}\">Computed tomography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/818983003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 818983003}\">Abdominal structure</a>, <a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/12921003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 12921003}\">Pelvic structure</a></td><td/><td/><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/SCT-STONE-EVAL\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct SCT-STONE-EVAL}\">Urinary tract stone evaluation</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CTA-ABDPELLE<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CTA-ABDPELLE\"> </a></td><td>CT, angiography, abdomen-pelvis-lower extremity, w iv contrast</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/418272005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 418272005}\">CT angiography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/818983003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 818983003}\">Abdominal structure</a>, <a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/12921003\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 12921003}\">Pelvic structure</a>, <a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/61685007\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 61685007}\">Lower limb structure</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/263543005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 263543005}\">Intravenous iodinated contrast</a></td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">CTA-CORONARY-LD<a name=\"precoordinated-radiology-CTA-CORONARY-LD\"> </a></td><td>CT, angiography, heart, coronary arteries, w iv contrast, low dose</td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/418272005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 418272005}\">CT angiography</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/SCT-HEART\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct SCT-HEART}\">Heart structure</a>, <a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/41801008\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 41801008}\">Coronary artery structure</a></td><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/263543005\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 263543005}\">Intravenous iodinated contrast</a></td><td/><td/><td><a href=\"http://snomed.info/sct/11000172109/id/SCT-LOW-DOSE\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct SCT-LOW-DOSE}\">Low dose technique</a></td></tr></table></div>"
